          "SPOKEN FRENCH drops words that",
          "written French keeps. Meet the",
          "casual, spoken register:",
          "",
          "NE-DROP — in fast speech, 'ne' often     Press 1",
          "vanishes; 'pas' alone still negates:",
          "Je sais pas. (I don't know.)",
          "",
          "J'ai pas le temps.                       Press 2",
          "(I don't have time.)",
          "",
          "C'est pas grave.                         Press 3",
          "(It's not a big deal.)",
          "",
          "WRITE 'ne...pas' in full, always —",
          "this is a LISTENING skill: recognize",
          "it when French is spoken naturally."
        ],
