        "content": [
          "ON REPLACES NOUS in spoken French —",
          "same meaning, il/elle verb ending:",
          "",
          "Nous allons au marché.                   Press 1",
          "(written/formal)",
          "On va au marché.",
          "(spoken — same meaning)",
          "",
          "On est prêts ?                           Press 2",
          "(Are we ready? — spoken)",
          "",
          "REGISTER AWARENESS, side by side:",
          "WRITTEN/FORMAL: nous, ne...pas full",
          "SPOKEN/CASUAL: on, ne dropped",
          "",
          "Your tu/vous choice from Core still",
